    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>“如果你是来给我带来温暖的，那确实是我。”恢复了体温的戴莉在麋鹿的头顶蹦跶了几下，继续说道：“我叫戴莉， 你的名字是什么？”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW> “我是……抱歉，我忘记了我的名字。”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>戴莉这才注意到，麋鹿的角上挂着许多小木牌，上面写着“我叫邓恩”、我是森林的守护者”、“每天巡逻看谁需要帮助”……</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>“你叫邓恩，”戴莉轻声说，她听树洞里的松鼠一家提起过这头每到冬天就会失忆的麋鹿，曾一天给他们送了三次松子，“你是银雾森林的守护者。”</>"] = "<InvDefault_HW>\"Если ты пришел согреть меня, то это действительно я\". Дейли, восстановив температуру своего тела, несколько раз прыгнула на голову лося и продолжила: \"Меня зовут Дейли. Как тебя зовут?\" name.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>Только тогда Дейли заметил, что на рогах лося висит множество маленьких деревянных табличек, на которых написаны такие слова, как «Меня зовут Данн», «Я страж леса», «Патрулируйте каждый день, чтобы увидеть, кому нужно». помогите \"...</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW> \"Вас зовут Данн\", - тихо сказал Дейли. Она слышала, как семейство белок в дупле дерева упоминало этого лося, который каждую зиму терял память, поскольку однажды он доставлял им кедровые орешки три раза за один день: «Ты - Хранитель Леса Серебряного Тумана». </>",
    ["\"It's a great helper for Spirit Mediumship, and also a charming flower spirit...\"\n As Daly spoke, Klein felt her voice coming from all directions.\n Looking around in confusion, Klein found that everything was swaying and blurring, as if shrouded in layers of thick fog. Even his own body was swaying, blurring, floating, and losing its weight.\n The reds became redder, the blues bluer, and the blacks blacker, the colors mixing like an impressionist oil painting, hazy and dreamlike. The fragmented, overlapping whispers around him came in waves, as if countless invisible people were discussing.\n \"This is similar to the feeling I had when I did the 'Fortune-Turning Ritual', but without that flavor that makes people go crazy or want to explode...\" Klein thought, looking at all this in confusion.\n Just then, his gaze was drawn to a pair of eyes as crystalline as emeralds. Daly, dressed in a black robe, sat on a blurry \"sofa,\" her gaze strangely focused on the top of Klein's head, her voice smiling gently:\n \"Let's get to know each other formally. I am the 'Spirit Medium', Daly.\"\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 14: Letter"] = "\"It's a great helper for Spirit Mediumship, and also a charming flower spirit...\"\n As Daly spoke, Klein felt her voice coming from all directions.\n Looking around in confusion, Klein found that everything was swaying and blurring, as if shrouded in layers of thick fog. Even his own body was swaying, blurring, floating, and losing its weight.\n The reds became redder, the blues bluer, and the blacks blacker, the colors mixing like an impressionist oil painting, hazy and dreamlike. The fragmented, overlapping whispers around him came in waves, as if countless invisible people were discussing.\n \"This is similar to the feeling I had when I did the 'Fortune-Turning Ritual', but without that flavor that makes people go crazy or want to explode...\" Klein thought, looking at all this in confusion.\n Just then, his gaze was drawn to a pair of eyes as crystalline as emeralds. Daly, dressed in a black robe, sat on a blurry \"sofa,\" her gaze strangely focused on the top of Klein's head, her voice smiling gently:\n \"Let's get to know each other formally. I am the 'Spirit Medium', Daly.\"\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 14: Letter",
